Falco catalogs (catalogs/falco/), generated by scripts/sync_falco_catalog.py.

fields.toml: the libsinsp field tables (falcosecurity/libs,
userspace/libsinsp/sinsp_filtercheck_*.cpp), with each field's type and flags,
and Falco's list of deprecated fields (falcosecurity/falco,
userspace/engine/falco_load_result.cpp); and the field tables of the Falco
plugin READMEs (falcosecurity/plugins: k8saudit, k8saudit-eks, cloudtrail,
okta, github, gcpaudit, json, k8smeta, container). Copyright The Falco Authors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE.txt). Field names,
types, flags and descriptions are reformatted.

events.toml: event names, event codes and argument names and types from the
driver's event table (falcosecurity/libs driver/event_table.c), and the
syscall names of driver/ppm_events_public.h. Copyright The Falco Authors; the
driver tables are dual licensed MIT or GPL-2.0-only (MIT used here). Names and
types are reformatted.

defaults.toml: the macros and lists of the Falco default rules
(falcosecurity/rules rules/*.yaml and the plugins' rules files), Copyright The
Falco Authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE.txt).
Conditions are kept with their whitespace collapsed; items are unchanged.
